    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Santa's Amazing Christmas Wonderland Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy Happy Holidays in Springfield. Help Santa in his Brand New house &amp; North Pole Workshops. Fly in his New Sleigh. Visit Santa's Amazing 'Frozen World' Grotto. Enjoy a sensational Celebrity Banquet. Spend Christmas at Liberty Valley Winter Resort!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate the Your Own Christmas Wonderland House. Win fabulous Rewards &amp; Achievements. Search for Frosty the Snowman. Take photos, make an Album.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Toys are made and it's Christmas Eve! Rudolph &amp; team are hitched to the Sleigh. Santa flies around the World while Kids are asleep, or are they? ... soon it's another wonderful Christmas Morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Santa find Hidden Objects, Lost Presents, Gold Angels. Play superb Mini-Games. Earn Merit Badges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas Wonderland 15 is crammed full of Presents &amp; Hidden Surprises with Gorgeous Graphics and Puzzles. Play in 3 modes (Casual, Challenge, Extreme - collect ALL against the clock) Join in the fun, with Captivating Christmas gameplay for Families and Friends of All Ages &amp; Abilities to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to Liberty Valley Winter Resort.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a Sensational Xmas Banquet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Make Charity Care Packs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Modes, Casual, Challenge, Extreme!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Extreme Mode Rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus Locations, Graphics &amp; Gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mega Collection of Bonus Puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Wallpapers &amp; Music Player.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
